      "translations": {
        "en": "I saw 'Abdullah ibn Junadub at the Standing (at Arafat), and I did not see a standing that was better than his standing. He remained extending his hand to the sky, with his tears flowing down his cheeks until they reached the ground. When the people were dismissed, I said, 'O Abu Muhammad, I have never seen a standing better than your standing.'"
      }
